title: Geofence
text: The fence around the no-fly zone looks complete, and nothing may land inside or near it. Two parcels are waiting in there. Drones are small.
trick: the rounded fence leaves a diagonal seam at each corner; light slips between two walls that touch only at a corner. Yellow and cyan share green, so the prism must sit on the north-west seam's line; red and blue then have to swap sides, each going the long way round to the far corner and turning in with a bender, because blue leaves the prism eastward but must enter from the south-west
motif: pictogram: a fenced no-fly zone (occupied squares inside and in a buffer around it), a few landing pads, open land to the south
expect: shared>=1
